      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Spiral Swing",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "flourish"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Tokainen is wielding her meteor hammer and is in Channel Cataclysm stance\n\n---\nEffect Tokainen swings her meteor hammer in a wide circle, dealing 4d8 bludgeoning,4d8 fire damage to each enemy in a 10-foot emanation. Tokainen can't use Spiral Swing again for 1d4 rounds."
